- I did not read `src/context.ts` in full — I'm relying on field usage (`context.error`, `context.finalized`, `context.res`) as seen in `compose.ts`/`hono-base.ts`, not the `Context` class internals (e.g., exactly how `finalized` gets flipped).
- I did not check whether any built-in middleware in `src/middleware/*` calls `compose()` directly or implements additional error-handling wrappers of its own.
- I did not verify behavior for streaming responses / `c.newResponse` edge cases beyond what's shown in the default `errorHandler`.
